# Local-only files that must never be committed. These sat untracked for months
# and were swept into a merge commit by `git add -u` (caught and amended before
# any push) — `-u` stages anything already in the index, so it is not the safe
# alternative to `git add .` it looks like. Ignoring them removes the trap.
.env.backup-*
casdoor-rehash
local_*_tmp/
